Subject: [PATCH] ipmi: parse platform events by channel and retain raw SEL metadata

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD IPMI event integration]

Share legacy/dynamic handling, accept proper local D-Bus and LAN framing,
validate optional event-data lengths and preserve assertion direction and
all supplied bytes. Read optional SEL metadata without remapping it onto
BMC sensors. Existing path-based and OEM records remain readable.

---
--- a/sensorhandler.cpp
+++ b/sensorhandler.cpp
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 #include "config.h"
 
 #include "sensorhandler.hpp"
+#include "platform_event.hpp"
 
 #include "fruread.hpp"
 
@@ -1519,83 +1520,10 @@
         t.upperNonRecoverable, 0, 0, 0, 0);
 }
 
-static bool isFromSystemChannel()
-{
